<title>POLAND: Elektrim plans convertible bond issue.</title>
<headline>Elektrim plans convertible bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trading and industrial conglomerate Elektrim SA plans a convertible bond issue and a new share issue ex-rights, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the management's proposal has to be approved by the general shareholders meeting on January 31. It gave no further details and company officials declined comment on the planned issues.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
